### ===== STEP 2: STUDENT MANAGEMENT =====

### 2.1 Get My Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/me
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 2.2 Update My Profile
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/students/me
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fullName": "Nguyen Van A Updated",
    "studentCode": "SV001",
    "phone": "0123456789",
    "department": "Computer Science",
    "skills": ["JavaScript", "Node.js", "React"],
    "year": 4
}

### 2.3 Upload CV (Create test-files/cv.pdf first)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/students/upload-cv
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cv"; filename="cv.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./test-files/cv.pdf
--MyBoundary--

### 2.4 Get Student by ID (Use real student ID from profile response)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/students/{{student_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{lecturer_token}}

### ===== STEP 3: INTERNSHIP MANAGEMENT =====

### 3.1 List Available Internships
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/available
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 3.2 Get My Internship
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/me
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 3.3 Register for Internship (Use real internship ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/register/{{internship_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 3.4 Cancel Registration
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 3.5 Suggest New Topic
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/suggest-topic
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "suggestedTitle": "AI Chatbot Development",
    "suggestedDescription": "Develop an AI-powered chatbot for customer service",
    "companyName": "Tech Startup XYZ",
    "position": "AI Developer Intern"
}

### 3.6 List All Internships (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/internships/all
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### ===== STEP 4: PROGRESS MANAGEMENT =====

### 4.1 Create Progress Report
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/progress/
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "week": 1,
    "title": "Week 1 Progress Report",
    "content": "This week I completed the project setup and initial research. Key achievements include setting up development environment, studying existing solutions, and creating project timeline.",
    "reportType": "weekly"
}

### 4.2 Get My Progress List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/progress/me
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 4.3 Get My Progress by Week
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/progress/me/week/1
Authorization: Bearer {{student_token}}

### 4.4 Lecturer - View Student Progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/progress/student/{{student_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{lecturer_token}}

### 4.5 Lecturer - Update Progress Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/progress/{{progress_id}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{lecturer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

